1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch11","children":["FOSA丨11丨管道架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨11丨管道架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十一章的课后思考题，深入探讨管道架构中管道双向性的可能性与限制、过滤器类型的分类与作用机制、数据流向的设计原则，以及管道架构的分区特性、模块化支持方式和典型应用场景分析，帮助理解管道与过滤器架构的核心概念和设计模式，提升架构师在处理数据流应用时的架构选择能力和系统设计水平。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-15T10:20:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/15"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,531"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十一章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Can pipes be bidirectional in a pipeline architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在管道架构中管道可以是双向的吗？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Name the four types of filters and their purpose."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"说出 4 种类型的过滤器及它们的作用。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Can a filter send data out through multiple pipes?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"一个过滤器能否通过多条管道将数据发送出去？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Is the pipeline architecture style technically partitioned or domain partitioned?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"管道架构是技术分区还是领域分区？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"In what way does the pipeline architecture support modularity?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"管道架构是如何支持模块化的呢？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Provide two examples of the pipeline architecture style."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"举 2 个管道架构的例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"拓扑","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#拓扑","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#拓扑"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"拓扑","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":4,"offset":703},"end":{"line":31,"column":6,"offset":705}}}]},"children":"拓扑"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250715105907327.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 11-2. Pipeline architecture example","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250715105907327.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 11-2. Pipeline architecture example"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1,"offset":707},"end":{"line":33,"column":131,"offset":837}}}}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"管道架构，又称为管道与过滤器架构（Pipes and Filters Architecture），是一种用于处理数据流的强大模式。它的核心思想非常直观，就像一条工厂的流水线：原材料从一端进入，经过一系列独立工站的加工、处理、检验，最终在另一端形成成品。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"要理解管道架构，首先要理解它的两个基本构件："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"过滤器 (Filter)"}],"：它是一个独立的、可执行的处理单元，负责接收数据、执行单一任务（例如转换格式、过滤内容、扩充信息），然后将处理后的数据传递出去。关键在于，每个过滤器都是**自包含（Self-Contained）","$L9","无状态（Stateless）**的，它不关心上一个过滤器是谁，也不关心下一个过滤器是谁。"]}],"\n","$La","\n"]}],"\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19"]}]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}],"$L1d"]}]]}]}]
